<topic id="new_dita_topic">
    <title>New DITA Topic</title>
    <body>
        <p>You can use the <uicontrol>New DITA Topic</uicontrol> action from the <uicontrol>AI
                Positron Assistant</uicontrol>
            <menucascade>
                <uicontrol>Actions</uicontrol>
                <uicontrol>Content Generation</uicontrol>
            </menucascade> category to ask the <b>AI Positron</b> to create a new DITA topic
            containing content expanded by the <b>AI</b> based on an initial idea expressed in plain
            text format.</p>
    </body>
